@host = https://localhost:7080
# After logging in, paste the accessToken here:
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 1. Plans (public)
GET {{host}}/api/public/plans

### 2. Sign up: creates the tenant, its first branch and the owner (14-day trial)
POST {{host}}/api/public/sign-up
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerName": "Owner Name", "mobile": "01000000000", "email": "owner@example.com", "password": "pass1234",
  "pharmacyNameEn": "Al Shifa Pharmacy", "pharmacyNameAr": "صيدلية الشفاء", "customerType": "Pharmacy",
  "governorate": "Beni Suef", "city": "Beni Suef", "address": "1 Main St",
  "licenceNumber": "L-1001", "commercialRegisterNumber": "CR-1001", "taxRegistrationNumber": "TR-1001"
}

### 3. Log in (returns accessToken)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "login": "owner@example.com", "password": "pass1234" }

### 4. Billing page
GET {{host}}/api/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Create a pharmacist (PIN is used to approve Rx sales and overrides)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Dr. Pharmacist", "mobile": "01000000001", "email": "pharmacist@example.com", "password": "pass1234",
  "pin": "2222", "roleCode": "PHARMACIST", "branchIds": [1], "isPharmacist": true,
  "licenceNumber": "PH-77", "licenceExpiry": "2028-12-31"
}

### 6. Create an item (a box of 3 strips x 10 tablets, 90 EGP)
POST {{host}}/api/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "PARA500", "nameEn": "Paracetamol 500mg", "nameAr": "باراسيتامول ٥٠٠", "scientificName": "Paracetamol",
  "strength": "500mg", "dosageForm": "Tablet", "stripsPerBox": 3, "unitsPerStrip": 10, "officialPrice": 90,
  "sellingPrice": 90, "vatRate": 0, "etaItemCode": "EG-000-1", "isRxOnly": false, "controlSchedule": "None",
  "reorderLevel": 60, "barcodes": ["6221234567890"]
}

### 7. Create a supplier
POST {{host}}/api/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nameEn": "Main Distributor", "nameAr": "الموزع الرئيسي", "type": "Distributor", "taxNumber": "", "phone": "", "paymentTermDays": 30, "creditLimit": 0 }

### 8. Receive goods: 10 boxes + 1 bonus at 100 EGP (unit cost becomes 90.91)
POST {{host}}/api/goods-receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branchId": 1, "supplierId": 1, "purchaseOrderId": null, "supplierInvoiceNumber": "INV-1",
  "lines": [ { "itemId": 1, "batchNumber": "B-2028-03", "expiryDate": "2028-03-31", "quantityBoxes": 10, "bonusBoxes": 1, "costPerBox": 100, "discountPercent": 0, "shelfLifeOverrideReason": null } ]
}

### 9. POS search
GET {{host}}/api/items/search?branchId=1&term=para
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Open a shift
POST {{host}}/api/shifts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "branchId": 1, "terminalCode": "POS-1", "openingFloat": 200 }

### 11. Sell 1 box + 1 strip, cash
POST {{host}}/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branchId": 1,
  "lines": [ { "itemId": 1, "unit": "Box", "quantity": 1 }, { "itemId": 1, "unit": "Strip", "quantity": 1 } ],
  "payments": [ { "method": "Cash", "amount": 150 } ]
}

### 12. Return the strip
POST {{host}}/api/sales/1/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lines": [ { "lineNumber": 2, "quantity": 1, "isResaleable": true } ], "refundMethod": "Cash", "reason": "Customer changed mind" }

### 13. X-report, stock alerts, ETA queue, audit log
GET {{host}}/api/shifts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/stock/alerts?branchId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/eta-documents?status=Queued
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/audit-log?pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===== BRD 8.6 Prescriptions and 8.7 Controlled drugs =====
# Log in as the pharmacist for these: the owner is not a licensed pharmacist.

### 14. Find a medicine in the central drug database (sample data in 002_Seed.sql)
GET {{host}}/api/drugs?term=amox
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Item linked to the drug database: Rx status and control table come from it (owner)
POST {{host}}/api/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "AMX500", "nameEn": "Amoxicillin 500", "nameAr": "أموكسيسيلين 500", "scientificName": "Amoxicillin",
  "strength": "500mg", "dosageForm": "Capsule", "stripsPerBox": 2, "unitsPerStrip": 8, "officialPrice": 120,
  "sellingPrice": 120, "vatRate": 0, "isRxOnly": false, "controlSchedule": "None", "reorderLevel": 0, "drugId": 1
}

### 16. Patient with a penicillin allergy (US-RX-3)
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Mona Ali", "nationalId": "29001011234567", "mobile": "01011111111", "birthDate": "1990-01-01",
  "allergies": [ { "allergenCode": "PENICILLINS", "note": "rash" } ] }

### 17. Prescriber
POST {{host}}/api/prescribers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Dr Hany", "specialty": "GP", "licenceNumber": "LIC-77", "clinic": "Al Nour Clinic" }

### 18. Alerts panel before recording (AC-RX-1: allergy alert)
POST {{host}}/api/clinical-checks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "patientId": 1, "items": [ { "itemId": 2, "doseUnits": 1, "frequencyPerDay": 3 } ] }

### 19. Record the prescription: 3 boxes, no refills. The response carries the alerts.
POST {{host}}/api/prescriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "branchId": 1, "patientId": 1, "prescriberId": 1, "prescriptionNumber": "RX-100", "prescribedOn": "2026-11-25",
  "diagnosis": "Tonsillitis",
  "lines": [ { "itemId": 2, "unit": "Box", "quantity": 3, "refillsAllowed": 0, "doseUnits": 1, "frequencyPerDay": 3, "durationDays": 7 } ] }

### 20. Attach the prescription photo (stored encrypted; set PrescriptionImages:Key first)
POST {{host}}/api/prescriptions/1/images
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=rx

--rx
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="rx.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./rx.jpg
--rx--

### 21. Dispense 1 box at the till. The allergy alert needs an override with a reason (BR-RX-2).
#     Use the alert code returned by step 19.
POST {{host}}/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branchId": 1, "prescriptionId": 1,
  "lines": [ { "itemId": 2, "unit": "Box", "quantity": 1 } ],
  "payments": [ { "method": "Cash", "amount": 200 } ],
  "alertOverrides": [ { "alertCode": "ALLERGY:2:AMOXICILLIN", "reason": "Prescriber confirmed by phone" } ],
  "counsellingNote": "Take after meals, finish the course"
}

### 22. AC-RX-2: the prescription now shows 2 boxes remaining
GET {{host}}/api/prescriptions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 23. Labels in Arabic and English for that sale (RX-07)
GET {{host}}/api/sales/2/labels
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 24. Patient profile: allergies, history from every branch, what is still to collect (RX-08)
GET {{host}}/api/patients/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 25. Controlled register of an item, and its CSV for the inspector (CTL-04, CTL-07)
GET {{host}}/api/controlled-register?branchId=1&itemId=3&from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/controlled-register/export?branchId=1&itemId=3&from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 26. Weekly count of the locked cabinet, signed with the pharmacist's own PIN (CTL-06)
POST {{host}}/api/controlled-register/balance-checks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "branchId": 1, "itemId": 3, "countedQuantity": 40, "pin": "2222", "note": null }

### 27. Owner's alerts: mismatches and overdue counts (US-CTL-3)
GET {{host}}/api/controlled-register/status?branchId=1&onlyNeedingAttention=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
